    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδι-εξίτητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέξειμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that cannot be exhausted, infinite in extent</i> or
				<i>duration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				207b29
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Top.</u>
				86.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				2.4.7
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.554
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with no outlet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγυια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					9.20.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
